00:42:30,460 --> 00:42:35,880
Joey is a great guy...

788
00:42:36,050 --> 00:42:38,380
but we're just... We're so different.

789
00:42:38,550 --> 00:42:41,890
I mean, like, during your speech, he kept laughing at "Homo erectus."

790
00:42:42,050 --> 00:42:44,560
I knew that was him!

791
00:42:46,310 --> 00:42:50,100
Anyway, I just... I think it's for the best.

792
00:42:51,060 --> 00:42:55,150
Hey. Hey, you okay?

793
00:42:51,060 --> 00:42:55,150
I guess.

794
00:42:57,860 --> 00:42:59,820
There was...

795
00:43:00,990 --> 00:43:05,910
There was another reason that I thought it was time to end it with Joey.

796
00:43:06,660 --> 00:43:12,540
I started to realize that I was having feelings for someone else.

797
00:43:14,170 --> 00:43:16,710
Okay, Geller. Last day of the conference.

798
00:43:16,880 --> 00:43:19,220
You know what happens to the keynote speaker.

799
00:43:19,380 --> 00:43:22,760
Professor Klarik, we're in the middle of a conversation here.

800
00:43:22,930 --> 00:43:25,100
Can't you throw him in the pool later?

801
00:43:25,100 --> 00:43:27,020
Or we could throw you both in now.

802
00:43:27,180 --> 00:43:30,890
Okay, gentlemen, please. Aren't we a little old for this?

803
00:43:31,060 --> 00:43:33,730
I mean, we're scientists, all right? We're academics...

804
00:43:33,900 --> 00:43:37,780
and most importantly you will have to catch us first.

805
00:43:37,940 --> 00:43:40,360
Go! Go! Go!

806
00:43:49,370 --> 00:43:51,830
Okay, so it's tied again, 41 to 41.

807
00:43:53,790 --> 00:43:56,750
Okay, look, enough is enough. MONICA: No.

808
00:43:56,920 --> 00:43:59,190
I just have two more points to beat him.

809
00:43:59,190 --> 00:44:01,220
Monica, that was also true an hour ago!

810
00:44:01,380 --> 00:44:02,720
I mean, please, look at you.

811
00:44:02,890 --> 00:44:07,390
Your hand is blistered, you can barely stand, your hair is inexplicable!

812
00:44:09,980 --> 00:44:12,440
You've already proven you're just as good as he is.

813
00:44:12,600 --> 00:44:15,270
We missed our dinner reservation, let's go upstairs...

814
00:44:15,440 --> 00:44:18,270
order room service, take a shower and shave your head!

815
00:44:20,360 --> 00:44:23,150
I can't just walk away. I've put in four hours.

816
00:44:23,700 --> 00:44:26,070
You knew this about me when you married me.

817
00:44:26,240 --> 00:44:29,200
You agreed to take me in sickness and in health.

818
00:44:29,370 --> 00:44:31,660
Well, this is my sickness!

819
00:44:31,830 --> 00:44:35,540
What about the obsessive cleaning?

820
00:44:31,830 --> 00:44:35,540
That's just good sense.

821
00:44:39,170 --> 00:44:40,630
Ow!

822
00:44:43,680 --> 00:44:45,300
You okay?

823
00:44:43,680 --> 00:44:45,300
No, honey, I'm okay.

824
00:44:45,470 --> 00:44:49,430
Shake it off. Oh, no shaking. No shaking. No shaking.

825
00:44:53,230 --> 00:44:56,520
Oh, my God. I can't play.

826
00:44:56,690 --> 00:44:59,150
So you forfeit?

827
00:44:56,690 --> 00:44:59,150
Mike wins?

828
00:45:00,360 --> 00:45:03,570
I can't believe it. I lost.

829
00:45:06,870 --> 00:45:10,280
No, you didn't.

830
00:45:06,870 --> 00:45:10,280
What?

831
00:45:10,450 --> 00:45:13,620
Because I'm gonna play for you.

832
00:45:10,450 --> 00:45:13,620
You can't do that.

833
00:45:13,790 --> 00:45:17,130
It's okay. I don't care which of them I beat.

834
00:45:18,130 --> 00:45:21,750
Okay, we're taking that paddle home, mister.

835
00:45:25,220 --> 00:45:27,720
Honey, you don't have to do this.

836
00:45:25,220 --> 00:45:27,720
Yes, I do.

837
00:45:27,890 --> 00:45:30,470
I may not understand why you have to win so badly...

838
00:45:30,640 --> 00:45:33,220
...but if it's important to you, it's important to me.

839
00:45:33,390 --> 00:45:34,810
Because I love you.

840
00:45:35,980 --> 00:45:39,270
But you suck.

841
00:45:40,730 --> 00:45:42,400
You're welcome, sweetheart.

842
00:45:43,530 --> 00:45:45,950
All right, let's get this over with. Sudden death.

843
00:45:46,110 --> 00:45:49,870
Whoever wins this point, wins.

844
00:45:46,110 --> 00:45:49,870
Okay.

845
00:45:53,750 --> 00:45:58,540
Oh, my God. You're good.

846
00:45:53,750 --> 00:45:58,540
It's like watching porn.

847
00:46:04,210 --> 00:46:06,970
And that's how it's done.

848
00:46:08,800 --> 00:46:12,760
Oh, my God. Oh, my God. That was so amazing.

849
00:46:12,930 --> 00:46:14,640
Well, when did you...?

850
00:46:14,810 --> 00:46:18,690
Hold on, I almost forgot. Loser.

851
00:46:21,730 --> 00:46:25,070
When did you stop sucking?

852
00:46:21,730 --> 00:46:25,070
I never sucked. I just didn't want you...

853
00:46:25,240 --> 00:46:26,940
to know how good I was.

854
00:46:25,240 --> 00:46:26,940
Why?

855
00:46:27,110 --> 00:46:28,950
I don't know.

856
00:46:27,110 --> 00:46:28,950
Well, this is so great.

857
00:46:29,110 --> 00:46:32,030
Now we can enter doubles tournaments.

858
00:46:29,110 --> 00:46:32,030
That's why.

859
00:46:42,040 --> 00:46:43,670
They still looking for us?

860
00:46:42,040 --> 00:46:43,670
Yeah.

861
00:46:43,840 --> 00:46:46,760
The bartender said they split up into two search parties.

862
00:46:46,920 --> 00:46:49,220
The herbivores and the carnivores.

863
00:46:50,800 --> 00:46:54,260
You know, we, as a group, are not the coolest.

864
00:46:54,430 --> 00:46:56,310
Oh, look out.

865
00:47:02,820 --> 00:47:06,070
I don't think they saw us.

866
00:47:02,820 --> 00:47:06,070
I don't think they did.

867
00:47:12,570 --> 00:47:18,450
So I started to tell you something earlier. Um...

868
00:47:18,830 --> 00:47:24,250
There was another reason that I realized it was time to end it with Joey.

869
00:47:24,420 --> 00:47:29,760
I kind of realized I was starting to have feelings...

870
00:47:29,930 --> 00:47:31,880
for someone else.

871
00:47:33,050 --> 00:47:34,600
Oh.

872
00:47:35,310 --> 00:47:37,640
And can I ask who?

873
00:47:38,980 --> 00:47:40,890
I think you know.

874
00:47:42,100 --> 00:47:47,320
I think I know too, but I've been really wrong about this stuff in the past, so...

875
00:48:05,840 --> 00:48:10,420
I'm sorry, we can't.

876
00:48:05,840 --> 00:48:10,420
All right. All right.

877
00:48:10,590 --> 00:48:14,050
I mean, you just went out with my best friend, you know?

878
00:48:14,640 --> 00:48:17,970
I just think it would be a really, really bad idea.

879
00:48:22,020 --> 00:48:24,560
Or not. I mean...

880
00:49:02,310 --> 00:49:03,390
What?

881
00:49:11,740 --> 00:49:12,900
Oh.

